  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/ec6be8e6-9e35-43e8-a044-ae51bd652f8c-image.png\" style=\"width: 230px; height: 197px;\" />​<br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mn>4</mn><msup><mn>5</mn><mo>&#8728;</mo></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>0</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>20</mn><mrow><mi>tan</mi><msup><mn>30</mn><mo>&#8728;</mo></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>20</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p><p><be><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>O</mi></math></be><be></be></p><p><be><math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mn>0</mn> <msqrt> <mn>3</mn> </msqrt> <mo>-</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </math></be></p><p><be></be><be><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>0</mn><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math><br /><br />It took <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sec</mi></math> to travel distance&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi></math>.<br /><br /><mrow> <mo><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math></mo> Speed <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>0</mn><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>sec</mi></math>.</mrow></be></p>",
